Package: dahlia-archive-keyring
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Dahlia Linux <https://github.com/Fabiy99/dahlia-linux>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: Dahlia Linux apt repository key and source
 Public signing key of the Dahlia Linux apt repository and the apt source
 that points to it. With this package installed, new Dahlia releases are
 installed with "apt update && apt upgrade".
